  lines:
  - '* (Don''t want to walk to the\n  other side of town?)'
  - '* (Try the undersnow tunnels!)^05\n* (They''re efficiently laid out.)'
  - '* How is crawling any\n  faster than running???'
  sounds:
  - snd_text
  - snd_text
  - snd_txtsus
  speed: 00000000
  portraits:
  - 
  - 
  - su_annoyed
  remarks: []
  secondaryLines: 0
  lines2:
  - '* Okay,^05 so what if instead\n  of fighting whoever\n  these weirdos are...'
  - '* We talk them out of\n  fighting us.'
  - '* They seem like they''d\n  be normal enough to\n  actually TALK to.'
  - '* I can''t really see that\n  happening,^05 but I guess\n  it''s worth a try...?'
